Step 1: Create a Module
First, create a new Python file named calc.py. Save this file in a folder of your choice. Inside the file, define two simple functions named add() and subtract().

# calc.py
def add(x, y):
    return (x+y)

def subtract(x, y):
    return (x-y)

By saving this file with the .py extension, you have created your own Python module.
